1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,846
Writing, task one. Form number 1. You want to join a fitness centre. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:14,694
What sport do you do and how often?

3
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,860
I go running in the park three times a week and in winter I sometimes swim in the pool.

4
00:00:29,767 --> 00:00:32,001
Why do you want to come to our fitness centre?

5
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:47,011
I want to come to your centre because it is close to my home and you have modern machines.

6
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,437
When do you have time to exercise?

7
00:00:59,833 --> 00:01:04,235
I have time to exercise mainly in the evening after work, from six o'clock, and at the weekend.

8
00:01:05,133 --> 00:01:14,760
Fill in form 1 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
